  useCommands((id,e)=>{if(id==='cancel'){if(cameraDraft)setCameraDraft(null);if(dialog)setDialog('');else{cancel();setContext(null);setIssueOpen(false);}return true;}if(dialog||busy)return false;if(id==='save'||id==='saveAs'){if(e.target instanceof HTMLInputElement)e.target.blur();void save(id==='saveAs');return true;}if(cameraEdit&&!['undo','redo','camera','cameraRegions','settings','panels','run','runGroup','mechanisms'].includes(id))return false;switch(id){case'copy':void capture();break;case'paste':pasteBundle();break;case'undo':undo();break;case'redo':undo(false);break;case'duplicate':if(workshop==='cameraRegions'){if(cameraRegionId)void cameraObjectAction({action:'clone',id:cameraRegionId,offset:[2,0,0]});}else duplicate();break;case'delete':if(workshop==='cameraRegions'){setStatus('请在区域面板删除，并检查受影响的引用');break;}if(entryId)deleteEntry(entryId);else remove();break;case'turn':case'turnBack':if(!placing)return false;if(['Wall_Set','Ocean_Map'].includes(objects?.presets.find(p=>p.key===placing.key)?.type??'')){setStatus('原生地形和水格保持轴对齐');break;}setPlacing(p=>p?{...p,yaw:(p.yaw+(id==='turnBack'?-90:90)+360)%360}:p);break;case'panels':setLayout(v=>({...v,leftOpen:!v.leftOpen,rightOpen:!v.rightOpen,bottomOpen:!v.bottomOpen}));break;case'sample':startSample();break;case'height':setHeightMode(v=>{const next=v==='surface'?'locked':'surface';writePref('heightMode',next);return next;});break;case'up':case'down':if(view!=='world')setLayer(v=>v+(id==='up'?1:-1));break;case'brushUp':case'brushDown':setBrush(v=>Math.max(1,Math.min(9,v+(id==='brushUp'?2:-2))));break;case'workplane':setWorkplaneRequest(n=>n+1);break;case'run':if(view!=='world')void launch({mode:'single',levelIds:[view]});else setStatus('先选择一个小关卡');break;case'runGroup':setDialog('runSubset');break;case'settings':setDialog('settings');break;case'cameraRegions':if(view==='world'){setStatus('请先进入小关卡编辑原生区域');break;}cancel();setCameraEdit(false);setSelection([]);setEntryId(null);setWorkshop('cameraRegions');setLayout(v=>({...v,rightOpen:true}));break;case'mechanisms':setCameraEdit(false);setCameraDraft(null);toggleWorkshop('mechanisms');break;case'camera':if(view==='world'){setStatus('原生相机编辑用于小关卡');break;}cancel();setCameraEdit(v=>!v);setWorkshop('camera');setLayout(v=>({...v,rightOpen:true}));break;case'floor':case'wall':case'erase':cancel();setSelection([]);setTool(id);break;default:return false;}return true;},20);

